@PharoApi = http://127.0.0.1:5080

GET {{PharoApi}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Sorted instruments in the supplied dataset
GET {{PharoApi}}/api/instruments
Accept: application/json

### Full chronological closing-price series (currency is unspecified)
GET {{PharoApi}}/api/prices/TICK0001
Accept: application/json

### Percentage-valued total return, daily sample volatility, and maximum drawdown
GET {{PharoApi}}/api/prices/TICK0001/stats
Accept: application/json

### Unknown instruments return a safe 404 ProblemDetails response
GET {{PharoApi}}/api/prices/UNKNOWN/stats
Accept: application/problem+json
